An enlargement on the beaks of 
some species of birds, including many 
hornbills;

Cell membrane
The outer membrane of the cell; 
the plasma membrane.

Cell theory
All living things are composed of cells; 
cells arise only from other cells.

Alternative names 
for the phylum have included Nemertini, 
Nemertinea and Rhynchocoela.

Zooids are multicellular; 
their structure is similar to that of other 
solitary animals.
